silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ThesisYonedaHomLegGranite', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, The validation_surface arrow assigns each typed chunk to its shape predicate (e.g., VetRecordShape for evidence-leg chunks about Mittens)." .
